              "id": "CVE-2026-41846",
              "name": "LanguageSpecificPackageVulnerability",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "Spring Framework: Spring Framework: Cross-site scripting (XSS) via user-supplied values in JSP form tags"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "Spring MVC applications which accept user-supplied values in the cssClass, cssErrorClass, or cssStyle attributes of JSP form tags allow arbitrary HTML/JavaScript code injection, potentially resulting in a cross-site scripting (XSS) vulnerability.\n\nAffected versions:\nSpring Framework 7.0.0 through 7.0.7; 6.2.0 through 6.2.18; 6.1.0 through 6.1.27; 5.3.0 through 5.3.48."
